Package: paperweight-plymouth
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, plymouth, plymouth-label
Description: PaperweightOS Plymouth theme — Catppuccin Macchiato
 Installs a Catppuccin Macchiato-themed Plymouth boot splash for PaperweightOS.
 Uses the script plugin: solid base (#24273a) background with a pulsing
 centered "PaperweightOS" label.
 .
 Sets the Plymouth default theme and rebuilds the initramfs on install and
 removal. On eMMC storage this may take 30-60 seconds.
